Usage:
  lark-cli docs +search [flags]

Flags:
      --as string           identity type: user (default "user")
      --dry-run             print request without executing
      --filter string       filter conditions (JSON object)
      --format string       output format: json (default) | pretty | table | ndjson | csv (default "json")
  -h, --help                help for +search
  -q, --jq string           jq expression to filter JSON output
      --page-size string    page size (default 15, max 20) (default "15")
      --page-token string   page token
      --query string        search keyword

Global Flags:
      --profile string   use a specific profile

